{
  "title": "Dua e Sahar يَامَفْزَعِيْ عِنْدَ كُرْبَتِي",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "يَامَفْزَعِيْ عِنْدَ كُرْبَتِي وَيَاغَوْثِيْ عِنْدَ شِدَّتِي\nYAA MAFZA-E'E I'NDA KURBATEE WA YAA GHAWTHEE I'NDA SHIDDATEE\nO my Safe haven at grievances! O my Aide at hardships!\nإِلَيْكَ فَزِعْتُ وَبِكَ اسْتَغَثْتُ وَبِكَ لُذْتُ\nILAYKA FAZIA'-TU WA BIKASTAGHATH-TU WA BIKA LUD'TU\nTo You do I turn, Your help do I seek, and with You do I take refuge.\nلَا اَلُوْذُ بِسِوَاكَ وَلَا اَطْلُبُ الْفَرَجَ إِلاَّ مِنْكَ\nLAA ALOOD'U BI-SIWAAKA WA LAA AT'LUBUL FARAJA ILLAA MINKA\nI seek refuge with none save You and I beseech none for relief save You.\nفَاَغِثْنِي وَفَرِّجْ عَنِّي\nFA-AGHITHNEE WA FARRIJ A'NNEE\nSo, please come to my help and free me from cares.\nيَا مَنْ يَقْبَلُ الْيَسِيْرَ وَيَعْفُوْ عَنِ الْكَثِيْرِ\nYAA MAN YAQBALUL YASEER WA YA'-FOO A'NIL KATHEER\nO He Who accepts even the least effort, and overlooks even great wrongdoing!\nاِقْبَلْ مِنِّي الْيَسِيْرَ وَاعْفُ عَنِّي الْكَثِيْرَ\nIQBAL MINNIL YASEERA WA A'-FU A'NNIL KATHEER\nAccept my little effort and overlook my much wrongdoing.\nإِنَّكَ اَنْتَ الْغَفُوْرُ الرَّحِيْمُ\nINNAKA ANTAL GHAFOORUR RAHEEM\nVerily, You are the Oft-Forgiving, the Merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ إِنِّي اَسْاَلُكَ إِيْمَانًا تُبَاشِرُ بِهِ قَلْبِي وَيَقِيْنًا\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA EEMAANAN TUBAASHIRU BIHEE QALBEE WA YAQEENAN\nO Allah, I ask You for faith with which You fill my heart, and for certitude,\nحَتَّى اَعْلَمَ اَنَّهُ لَنْ يُصِيْبَنِي إِلَّا مَاكَتَبْتَ لِيْ\nHATTAA A'-LAMA ANNAHU LAN YUSEEBANEE ILLAA MAA KATABTA LEE\nso that I may know that nothing will afflict me except what You have ordained for me.\nوَرَضِّنِيْ مِنَ العَيْشِ بِمَا قَسَمْتَ لِي\nWA RAZZINEE MINAL A'YSHI BIMAA QASAMTA LEE\nAnd make me content with the living You have apportioned for me,\nيَااَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nO most Merciful of the merciful!\nيَاعُدَّتِيْ فِي كُرْبَتِي وَيَاصَاحِبِي فِي شِدَّتِي\nYAA U'DDATEE FEE KURBATEE WA YAA SAAHIBEE FEE SHIDDATEE\nO my resource in my grief, and my companion in my hardship,\nوَيَاوَلِيّٖ فِي نِعْمَتِي وَيَاغَايَتِي فِي رَغْبَتِي\nWA YAA WALIYYEE FEE NI'-MATEE WA YAA GHAAYATEE FEE RAGHBATEE\nand my guardian in my blessing, and my ultimate goal in my desire,\nاَنْتَ السَّاتِرُ عَوْرَتِيْ وَالْاٰمِنُ رَوْعَتِيْ وَالْمُقِيْلُ عَثْرَتِيْ\nANTAS SAATIRU A'WRATEE WAL AAMINU ROO-A'TEE WAL MUQEELU A'THRATEE\nYou are the Concealer of my defects, the Securer of my fright, and the Overlooker of my slips,\nفَاغْفِرْ لِي خَطِيْئَتِي يَآاَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nFAGHFIR LEE KHATEE-ATEE YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nso forgive my sin, O most Merciful of the merciful!",
  "merits": "It is recommended to say this supplicatory prayer, considered the shortest supplicatory prayer to be said at the time of Sahar (pre-dawn). It is also mentioned in Iqbal al-A'mal."
}
